  "prefLabel": "Vet 307.02 Conditional License Duration",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Vet 307.02 Conditional License Duration.\n\n(a) Conditional licenses shall be valid for 2 years from the date of issuance, or until the licensee obtains ECFVG certification and receives a full license.\n\n(b) An ECFVG candidate, or a candidate for another certification program that meets the ECFVG or PAVE program minimum standards, who does not pass a CPE examination may apply to renew or reinstate their conditional license, however, a conditional license shall not be renewed or reinstated more than once.\n\nSource. #14397, eff 11-23-25, EXPIRES: 11-23-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/vet100-1000.html"
}
